DESCRIPTION >
    Phase 4 (Pattern B + C row-pull). Flat, site-scoped, date-windowed pull of
    `$conversion` rows. Replaces the HogQL `convSql` used by both
    `getMultiTouchAttributionLive` (api/lib/attribution-engine.js:1399, serves
    linear/u_shaped/time_decay/w_shaped) and `getAiPlatformAttributionLive`
    (api/lib/attribution-engine.js:374, serves ai_platforms). Column list is the
    superset of both call sites' SELECTs (browser_name/browser/page_url are
    AI-platform-only extras; harmless no-ops for the multitouch caller, which
    simply ignores the extra columns). See tinybird/PHASE4_4A_FIELD_MAPPING.md
    §1 for the verified per-column mapping.
    NOT YET VALIDATED against the live schema (no `tb build`/`tb push` run —
    pending founder go-ahead on cloud-touching CLI commands, see Phase 4a report).

TOKEN "phase4_conversions_read" READ

NODE conversions_by_site_node
SQL >
    %
    SELECT
        event_id,
        distinct_id,
        timestamp,
        conversion_type,
        conversion_value,
        utm_source,
        utm_medium,
        utm_campaign,
        referrer,
        ai_source,
        country,
        device_type,
        utm_term,
        provider,
        attribution_status,
        stitching_method,
        ingestion_method,
        browser_name,
        page_url
    FROM events
    WHERE site_id = {{ String(site_id, required=True) }}
      AND event_type = '$conversion'
      AND timestamp >= {{ DateTime(date_from, required=True) }}
      AND timestamp < {{ DateTime(date_to, required=True) }}
    ORDER BY timestamp DESC
    LIMIT 10000

TYPE endpoint
